Dispatch a consumer that reads what is presently
contained in all of ./Proofs/**/*.lean and mines
for anything related or unrelated in OEIS that
it comes across in either a random or principled
manner.

It should check ./Formalize to ensure that the
conjecture it wants to surface isn't already in
the corpus.

For each new thing it finds, write a similarly
styled markdown file to the `A*.md` that exist
with the similar metadata about the formalization
and proof difficultly guess.
